gument. We could also ask about adaptability, but not required now. We can give our provisional recommendation.\n\nThus produce public message: I agree with Agent 2, recommend Candidate B, citing his conscientiousness, stress handling, weather assessment, computer skills, but note concerns about memory and communication. Also mention need to discuss other candidates.\n\nLet's produce."}
