Thus produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE: \"I continue to support Candidate B as the leading choice. His conscientiousness, stress handling, weather assessment, and computer skills align with reliability, stress resilience, and technical competence. While his weak memory for numbers and occasional unprofessional remarks are concerns, they seem more remediable than the deeper attitude or communication issues seen in the other candidates. I suggest we now examine the adaptability and feedback orientation of each candidate to ensure we haven't overlooked a critical factor.\"\n\nMake sure it's concise.\n\nNow output."}
